# Mali Midgard GPU (ARM T820, sprd "sharkle" platform glue), r21p0 to match
# the stock libGLES_mali.so DDK compatibility check (UK version 11.0, see
# devices/MALI_R21P0.md). Module, like stock: the ramdisk insmods mali.ko.
# All watches: every stock boot image (K18, DM63, DW100U silver/V13M,
# MT107, MT108, DM82) ships mali.ko r21p0-01rel0 (UK 11.0), and their stock
# DT gpu@60000000 nodes are identical apart from phandle numbering.
CONFIG_MALI_MIDGARD=m
CONFIG_MALI_PLATFORM_NAME="sharkle"
# devfreq-based DVFS (stock's choice, confirmed from the stock mali.ko's own
# symbol table: it has kbase_devfreq_* backend functions, not a
# CONFIG_MALI_MIDGARD_DVFS in-driver polling thread). Uses the gpu node's
# "operating-points" table; CONFIG_PM_DEVFREQ and a governor are already on
# for every watch board.
CONFIG_MALI_DEVFREQ=y
